# What the backend needs, written loosely. requirements.txt is generated from this file.
#
# To change a dependency, edit THIS file, then rebuild the pinned list for the Python that
# production runs (render.yaml: 3.11.9):
#
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --python-version 3.11 --universal -o requirements.txt
#
# Pinning makes every build install exactly what was tested. The cost is that fixes no longer
# arrive by themselves: re-run the command above now and then, and check for advisories with
#   uvx pip-audit -r requirements.txt

